[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "教练双手揣在口袋里，假装自己是洛奇·巴尔博亚的教练米奇，或者是米老鼠，米老头，米什么玩意儿。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "idle",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "他嘴里哼哼着那首曲子，你知道的，就是那首，噔噔噔，噔噔噔。哦不对应该是噔噔灯？还是噔噔灯？",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "idle",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "想到这里一股无名怒火从你心里开始燃起，你的拳头给出了一个提议：“一拳打在他脸上！趁他两只手都在口袋里！”",
    "sortid": 3,
    "statename1": "think1",
    "statename2": "idle",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 2001
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "嘿，光屁股，你不是本地人吧。",
    "sortid": 4,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你开始用右手酝酿自己的决心，是的，该向世界展示下你自己的伟大了。",
    "sortid": 5,
    "statename1": "think1",
    "statename2": "idle",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "拳王已经连胜9场！我们拳馆派去的人被打的<color=red>满地找牙</color>。",
    "sortid": 6,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "我知道他们会说什么，哦，教练，哦···",
    "sortid": 7,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "这是我们的生活方式！",
    "sortid": 8,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "dialogid": 1,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "但是我说这是一场溃败，现在已经没有多余的牙齿用了，真的已经完全找不见了。",
    "sortid": 9,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 2001
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "哦！哦，操，哦，哦，不，哦······",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "angry",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "操你，唉，为什么！我是说，<color=red>嗯？</color>",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "angry",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "新的参赛者！新的参赛者！",
    "sortid": 3,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "教练朝拳台方向大喊，你好像不该揍他这一拳的，现在后悔还来得及吗？",
    "sortid": 4,
    "statename1": "think1",
    "statename2": "idle",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "你绝对可以终结他的九连胜，我说真的，我上次吃到这么重的一拳还是在9年前。",
    "sortid": 5,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "dialogid": 4,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "我带你了解更多",
    "sortid": 6,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "dialogid": 3,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "是吗，那跳够了再来找我吧，记得别搞到台子上了，否则他们非让你吃回去不可。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "dialogid": 5,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "是吗，我觉得至少不应该是9，不过我建议你藏好这个秘密，9之后的数字或许会在朋克城引起恐慌。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "talk",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "dialogid": 100,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "喂，你听说了吗？",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "dialogid": 100,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "听说什么？我什么都不知道。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "dialogid": 100,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "空气中弥漫着一股紧张的气氛。",
    "sortid": 3,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "dialogid": 100,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "算了，也没什么大不了的......",
    "sortid": 4,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "dialogid": 101,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "好吧，那我就直说了：<color=red>拳王要来这个镇子了。</color>",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "dialogid": 101,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "真的假的？！",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "dialogid": 101,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "这个消息像一阵风一样传遍了整个小镇。",
    "sortid": 3,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
    "dialogid": 200,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "神秘人从阴影中走出来，低声说道。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "dialogid": 200,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "你有两个选择，听好了。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "dialogid": 201,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "好吧，我选再来一遍！",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "dialogid": 201,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "神秘人叹了口气，又重复了一遍。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "dialogid": 202,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "够了够了，我不玩了！",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "dialogid": 202,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "神秘人露出了满意的微笑。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "dialogid": 203,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "很好，你终于做出了正确的选择。<color=red>记住，在朋克城，耐心比拳头更重要。</color>",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "dialogid": 203,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "神秘人消失在夜色中，只留下一个背影。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 300,
    "dialogid": 300,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你走进一家昏暗的酒馆，吧台后面站着一个老练的酒保。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 301,
    "dialogid": 300,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "哟，新面孔啊。想喝点什么，还是想打听点什么？",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 302,
    "dialogid": 301,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "酒保擦着杯子，等着你的回答。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 303,
    "dialogid": 302,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你转身离开了酒馆，身后的门吱呀一声关上了。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 304,
    "dialogid": 303,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "拳王？哈，那可是个大人物。听说他连胜了九场，没人能撑过一个回合。<color=red>不过最近有人说有个新来的要挑战他。</color>",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 305,
    "dialogid": 303,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "酒保压低了声音，仿佛在说什么秘密。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 306,
    "dialogid": 304,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "这个小镇？名字叫朋克城。别看它小，<color=red>这里可是地下拳赛的圣地。</color>每周都有人从各地赶来挑战拳王。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 307,
    "dialogid": 304,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "酒保指了指墙上的一张褪色的海报。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 400,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "夜幕降临，朋克城的霓虹灯逐一亮起。",
    "sortid": 1,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 401,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "街道上空无一人，只有远处传来的音乐声和偶尔的狗吠。",
    "sortid": 2,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 402,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你站在十字路口，不知道该往哪个方向走。",
    "sortid": 3,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 403,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "突然，一张被风吹过来的海报贴在了你脸上。",
    "sortid": 4,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 404,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你揭下来一看：<color=red>\"拳王挑战赛，今晚八点，地下竞技场。\"</color>",
    "sortid": 5,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 405,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 0,
    "content": "你看了看时间——七点四十五。",
    "sortid": 6,
    "statename1": "",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 406,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 1,
    "content": "你决定去地下竞技场看看。",
    "sortid": 7,
    "statename1": "idle",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 407,
    "dialogid": 400,
    "type": 2,
    "content": "来吧，让我看看你的实力。",
    "sortid": 8,
    "statename1": "talk",
    "statename2": "",
    "slotstateid1": 0,
    "slotstateid2": 0
  }
]